# Blood Moon on Dryad Arbor, a nonbasic Land Creature - Forest Dryad with a green color indicator. CR 305.7: setting its
# subtype to Mountain replaces its land type (Forest) and no other subtype, and adds or removes no card type, so in layer 4
# it is a Land Creature - Dryad Mountain; layer 5 is untouched, so it stays green by its color indicator (the rulings: "it
# continues to be a green Dryad creature"); its power and toughness stay 1/1. It has "{T}: Add {R}" (CR 305.6) and no
# longer "{T}: Add {G}". Before the Moon it taps for {G} (the positive control).

